WEBVTT

02:32.760 --> 02:35.440
How long has Ms. Ruoyao been inside?

02:35.520 --> 02:38.280
All day. She didn't even eat.

02:38.360 --> 02:40.400
And she instructed me
not to let anyone bother her.

02:43.760 --> 02:46.520
The tip of scorpion venom needles
are dipped into scorpion venom.

02:46.600 --> 02:48.480
Using it as acupuncture
can cause hallucinations.

02:48.560 --> 02:50.840
If the person receiving the treatment
can't handle it,

02:50.920 --> 02:52.240
she will go completely mad.

02:54.040 --> 02:55.160
I trust you, Ms. Situ.

02:55.760 --> 02:58.840
It's useless for you to trust me.
You must trust yourself.

02:59.400 --> 03:00.880
If you can't handle the pain later,

03:01.680 --> 03:02.680
I can't save you either.

03:03.320 --> 03:04.160
Got it.

04:36.600 --> 04:37.720
Why did you betray me?

04:42.880 --> 04:43.720
This is bad.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.720
She's starting to hallucinate.

04:46.680 --> 04:48.640
Xiao Heng, help me hold her down.

04:52.320 --> 04:54.080
I need to prepare
another dose of medicine.

04:54.160 --> 04:55.840
If she starts shaking, call me right away.

04:55.920 --> 04:56.760
All right.

05:05.600 --> 05:07.320
Now, you're trying to get Jiang Li.

05:07.400 --> 05:08.840
Which one are you planning

05:08.920 --> 05:10.120
to push out?

05:10.200 --> 05:12.120
I'm just trying to help Ms. Jiang Li.

05:12.200 --> 05:14.800
Besides, my marriage
with Jiang Ruoyao isn't set in stone yet.

05:14.880 --> 05:16.280
Go home now

05:16.360 --> 05:18.600
and break off your engagement
with Jiang Ruoyao,

05:18.680 --> 05:20.400
then get back with Jiang Li.

05:20.960 --> 05:24.200
Jiang Li, don't even think
about taking him away from me.

05:24.280 --> 05:25.760
I won't lose to you.

05:25.840 --> 05:27.200
Not in the past.

05:27.280 --> 05:28.600
And not tomorrow.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.840
No, we must give her the antidote now.

05:46.920 --> 05:47.840
Don't give up halfway.

05:49.600 --> 05:51.080
She hasn't gone mad from the pain.

05:51.880 --> 05:53.880
Her emotions
have just been suppressed for too long.

05:54.440 --> 05:55.720
Do you think she can handle it?

05:55.800 --> 05:57.920
She can handle it
even if it's a big challenge.

06:05.400 --> 06:06.240
Shen Yurong!

06:06.960 --> 06:08.440
Do you think no one will know

06:08.520 --> 06:09.680
what you've done?

06:09.760 --> 06:12.240
The heavens see everything.
Every evil deed faces retribution.

06:12.320 --> 06:14.120
I won't let you get away in this lifetime!

06:14.200 --> 06:16.000
You can't even stay
at the School of Integrity.

06:16.480 --> 06:17.680
How can you fight against me?

06:18.680 --> 06:19.800
Your hands are useless now.

06:20.560 --> 06:22.000
You can't play the guqin anymore!

06:23.200 --> 06:24.480
My hands!

06:25.040 --> 06:26.320
We have to stop this now.

06:26.400 --> 06:28.880
If we don't give her the antidote,
she can't hold on much longer.

06:29.360 --> 06:32.040
Li, look who's in front of you clearly.

06:32.120 --> 06:33.280
Li!

06:34.040 --> 06:35.040
Li.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.400
Jiang Li.

06:36.480 --> 06:37.440
Jiang Li!

06:46.840 --> 06:47.760
Don't bite yourself.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.840
You…

07:12.040 --> 07:13.280
Foolish behavior.

07:23.520 --> 07:25.240
Young Master, did you stay up all night?

07:28.800 --> 07:30.120
Is it already morning?

07:30.200 --> 07:31.040
Yes.

07:33.200 --> 07:36.040
Young Master, you've been reading
this page all night.

07:39.280 --> 07:40.360
Remember.

07:41.240 --> 07:44.440
You must let Jiang Li
win against Jiang Ruoyao.

07:44.520 --> 07:45.360
All right?

07:46.440 --> 07:48.400
If Jiang Li wins,
I'll bring you something delicious.

07:55.320 --> 07:56.400
Xu'er,

07:56.480 --> 07:58.760
are you still going
even when your hand is injured?

07:58.840 --> 08:00.920
I must attend Jiang Li's music exam.

08:04.240 --> 08:05.560
At the competition later,

08:06.240 --> 08:08.320
you will surely shine the brightest.

08:08.960 --> 08:11.000
I've taken care of everything for you.

08:11.480 --> 08:15.080
Please don't disappoint me again today.

08:15.640 --> 08:16.920
Yes, Mother.

08:37.720 --> 08:39.679
Why is his lordship
like a young lady today?

08:39.760 --> 08:41.120
He's taking such a long time
to get changed.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.360
Do you want to check on him?

09:23.800 --> 09:27.680
I killed Xue Fangfei with my own hands.

09:28.720 --> 09:30.040
I buried her myself.

09:31.160 --> 09:33.000
The current Jiang Li is just Jiang Li.

09:33.480 --> 09:36.920
No matter how much she resembles her,
she's not Xue Fangfei.

09:41.080 --> 09:43.000
Miss, do your best.

09:43.080 --> 09:43.960
I believe in you.

09:51.680 --> 09:53.600
Ladies and gentlemen!

09:53.680 --> 09:56.800
Place your bets!

09:56.880 --> 09:59.000
The wager
between Chancellor Li's son, Li Lian,

09:59.080 --> 10:02.240
and Chancellor Jiang's daughter, Jiang Li.

10:02.320 --> 10:05.560
Fifty-to-one odds!

10:05.640 --> 10:07.640
Ms. Jiang Li's team
is performing exceptionally well.

10:07.720 --> 10:10.040
Just one match is left.
Why haven't the odds changed at all?

10:10.120 --> 10:11.160
It's about capabilities.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.840
How can the tables always be turned?

10:12.920 --> 10:14.680
You must have bet

10:14.760 --> 10:16.160
your whole fortune on Mr. Li

10:16.240 --> 10:17.840
and just refused to admit it.

10:17.920 --> 10:20.120
- Right.
- Let's see who wins and who loses.

10:20.200 --> 10:21.760
Sure. Go ahead and place your bet.

10:21.840 --> 10:24.640
Decide and place your bets!

10:24.720 --> 10:26.200
I'm placing mine here.

10:26.760 --> 10:27.840
Come and place your bets!

10:27.920 --> 10:29.320
JIANG LI, LI LIAN

10:29.400 --> 10:31.320
- I'm betting on Mr. Li.
- I bet on Mr. Li too.

10:31.400 --> 10:33.520
- I'm placing my bet!
- All right.

10:34.000 --> 10:36.040
Messrs., your bets are noted.

10:36.120 --> 10:38.040
- All right.
- I'm placing my bet!

10:38.120 --> 10:39.320
JIANG LI

10:39.880 --> 10:41.920
ANNUAL EXAM, FOURTH DAY

10:42.000 --> 10:43.920
- They're quite impressive.
- Yes.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.400
Ms. Jiang Li is in good form today.

10:45.480 --> 10:47.280
This round is of utmost importance.

10:47.360 --> 10:48.480
Exactly.

10:48.560 --> 10:50.320
- What are you looking at?
- Check them out.

10:50.400 --> 10:52.800
Look at Ms. Jiang Li.
She's determined to win today.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.000
Did you see that?

10:59.080 --> 11:01.320
Everyone looks at our motley crew

11:01.400 --> 11:02.680
in a different light now.

11:05.280 --> 11:06.240
Also,

11:06.320 --> 11:07.600
many people regretted

11:07.680 --> 11:10.200
placing their bets on Meng Hongjin
and her team.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.880
Today is the final round.

11:12.960 --> 11:14.480
Everyone will be watching you.

11:14.560 --> 11:15.400
You can do it.

11:18.280 --> 11:19.120
Li Jin,

11:19.840 --> 11:23.040
the motley crew across is watching us.

11:28.960 --> 11:31.000
IMPERIAL ACADEMY

11:39.680 --> 11:40.840
Do you think

11:40.920 --> 11:43.320
someone will sabotage us?

11:43.880 --> 11:45.600
With so many people here,

11:46.160 --> 11:47.280
I don't think so.

11:52.720 --> 11:54.680
Students, come and draw your lots.

11:56.280 --> 11:58.080
Ninth, Liu Yuzhu.

11:59.120 --> 12:01.120
Tenth, Wang Qingqing.

12:01.760 --> 12:04.640
Eleventh, Jiang Ruoyao.

12:05.680 --> 12:08.600
Twelfth, Jiang Li.

12:09.520 --> 12:12.960
Please proceed with the exam
in the order of the lots drawn.

12:13.640 --> 12:15.600
We will test guqin skills today.

12:16.200 --> 12:17.720
There are five examiners in total.

12:18.280 --> 12:20.080
Apart from me, the other examiners are

12:20.880 --> 12:22.160
Fairy Jinghong…

12:24.240 --> 12:25.880
Fairy Jinghong?

12:25.960 --> 12:27.840
Wasn't she Wangxian Pavilion's
top performer?

12:27.920 --> 12:29.480
She used to charge a fortune for a song.

12:30.120 --> 12:32.600
I heard Fairy Jinghong
is living a blissful life after retiring

12:32.680 --> 12:33.760
from Wangxian Pavilion.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.200
I didn't expect to see her here.

12:35.280 --> 12:37.680
Court musician, Mian Ju.

12:37.760 --> 12:38.960
MIAN JU

12:39.040 --> 12:40.560
Mian Ju is a true master.

12:40.640 --> 12:42.040
And he's quite frank.

12:42.680 --> 12:45.240
This year's top scorer, Shen Yurong.

12:46.360 --> 12:49.360
Look, it's the devoted
top scorer, Mr. Shen.

12:49.440 --> 12:51.280
Is Mr. Shen also skilled in guqin?

12:51.360 --> 12:54.040
I heard his late wife
was a talented guqin player.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.000
Next…

12:57.640 --> 13:00.000
Ms. Xiao, the next person
hasn't arrived yet.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.560
Should we wait for him?

13:03.200 --> 13:06.480
He has always been unpredictable.
It's better if he doesn't show up.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.200
Let's begin.

13:10.200 --> 13:14.200
The guqin exam starts now.

13:14.280 --> 13:16.080
Ms. Xiao, you seem quite anxious.

13:24.360 --> 13:26.920
Duke Su, Xiao Heng.

13:40.600 --> 13:42.840
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

14:01.560 --> 14:02.480
- Duke Su.
- Duke Su.

14:02.560 --> 14:05.440
PROMOTE NOBLE MORALS
AND IDEAS, EXTENSIVE LEARNING

14:05.520 --> 14:06.520
Please go ahead.

14:08.760 --> 14:10.520
They even invited Duke Su.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.400
What a big surprise.

14:12.480 --> 14:14.840
His insights are highly valued
in entertainment houses here.

14:14.920 --> 14:17.720
Which singer or instrument player
wouldn't want his comments?

14:17.800 --> 14:19.800
Don't forget how Little Taohong
became popular.

14:21.760 --> 14:24.160
Let the competition begin.

14:25.960 --> 14:30.360
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

14:32.040 --> 14:33.120
IMPERIAL ACADEMY

15:00.640 --> 15:02.840
Next student, Jiang Ruoyao.

15:43.040 --> 15:44.440
It's "Wild Geese on the Shoal."

15:45.360 --> 15:47.320
You can recognize it from just one note?

16:07.120 --> 16:08.640
You're right.

16:08.720 --> 16:10.440
It's the most challenging piece
in the world.

16:10.520 --> 16:12.280
No one ever dared to play it
in the Annual Exam.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.240
Your sister is truly extraordinary.

16:26.000 --> 16:28.440
The song uses the grand ambition of a swan

16:28.520 --> 16:30.160
to describe the spirit of a hermit.

16:30.640 --> 16:32.560
The finger techniques
are extremely difficult.

16:32.640 --> 16:34.520
I didn't expect Ms. Ruoyao

16:34.600 --> 16:36.080
to actually master it.

16:37.280 --> 16:38.720
It's truly not easy.

16:39.520 --> 16:40.520
Fairy,

16:41.000 --> 16:43.800
you also gained fame in the capital
for "Wild Geese on the Shoal," right?

16:45.840 --> 16:47.200
Now that she mentioned it,

16:47.280 --> 16:48.360
this student

16:48.440 --> 16:50.880
sure resembles you in some ways.

16:52.200 --> 16:54.600
Indeed, the younger generation
truly has potential.

16:55.840 --> 16:58.120
Did Fairy Jinghong tutor her in private?

17:14.520 --> 17:18.280
IMPERIAL ACADEMY

18:58.360 --> 19:00.840
Marvelous.

19:00.920 --> 19:04.480
Even though Ms. Ruoyao
is young and inexperienced,

19:04.560 --> 19:06.600
she can play "Wild Geese on the Shoal,"

19:06.680 --> 19:08.360
capturing the various forms of wild geese

19:08.440 --> 19:11.040
and the graceful artistry of a hermit.

19:11.760 --> 19:14.440
When we talk about this piece of music
in the future,

19:14.520 --> 19:16.040
we won't be reminded of you first,

19:16.120 --> 19:18.960
but Ms. Jiang Ruoyao.

19:27.040 --> 19:28.640
- She played exceptionally well.
- Splendid.

19:28.720 --> 19:31.600
- Magnificent.
- Wonderful.

19:31.680 --> 19:35.080
- She's incredible.
- Yes.

19:36.280 --> 19:38.800
Twelfth student, Jiang Li.

19:42.160 --> 19:44.680
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

19:46.160 --> 19:49.280
Jiang Li is at a disadvantage
in going after Jiang Ruoyao.

19:49.360 --> 19:50.840
Even the heavens are helping us.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.840
The heavens are helping us?

20:00.560 --> 20:01.760
It could be a human deed too.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.680
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

20:12.360 --> 20:13.480
Look at this guqin.

20:14.080 --> 20:15.160
Do you like it?

20:19.240 --> 20:20.240
Yes.

20:22.240 --> 20:24.440
Father, this guqin must be expensive.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.920
We already have one at home.

20:27.000 --> 20:28.120
Just return this one.

20:28.200 --> 20:30.920
I originally saved some money

20:31.000 --> 20:32.600
to buy wine.

20:32.680 --> 20:34.000
But after giving it a thought,

20:34.080 --> 20:36.000
I decided to buy a guqin
for my daughter instead.

20:36.080 --> 20:36.960
You see,

20:37.480 --> 20:39.720
you've been repairing and maintaining
your guqin for years.

20:39.800 --> 20:41.040
It's time for a new one.

20:41.120 --> 20:42.480
I can't accept this, Father.

20:42.560 --> 20:43.720
This guqin is too expensive.

20:44.200 --> 20:46.160
If I knew learning guqin can be so costly,

20:46.840 --> 20:48.120
I wouldn't have started learning.

20:48.200 --> 20:50.760
Xue Li, don't say that.

20:51.280 --> 20:52.760
You love playing the guqin.

20:53.320 --> 20:55.640
Besides, mastering a skill

20:56.200 --> 20:57.960
might bring you

20:58.040 --> 20:59.600
some opportunities someday.

21:02.200 --> 21:04.120
- Why isn't she starting yet?
- Right.

21:04.200 --> 21:05.200
Yes.

21:05.280 --> 21:07.160
- What is she waiting for?
- Why isn't she playing?

21:07.240 --> 21:09.400
Could it be she doesn't know
how to play the guqin?

21:10.200 --> 21:11.560
Well, that would make sense.

21:11.640 --> 21:13.640
Zhennv Hall doesn't teach guqin.

21:13.720 --> 21:15.200
- Yes.
- What's going on?

21:17.040 --> 21:18.040
Be patient.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.200
What is this?

21:52.960 --> 21:54.680
Playing such an unknown tune

21:54.760 --> 21:55.840
is embarrassing.

21:57.320 --> 21:58.520
Can she even play the guqin?

22:00.240 --> 22:01.440
After such a good performance,

22:01.960 --> 22:04.040
this one is really
a bit hard to listen to.

22:04.520 --> 22:06.040
What piece is this?

22:06.120 --> 22:08.080
Why haven't I ever heard it before?

22:08.160 --> 22:09.920
She's playing

22:10.000 --> 22:12.840
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms."

22:14.760 --> 22:16.440
When I was traveling,

22:16.520 --> 22:18.280
I heard this song.

22:19.160 --> 22:21.320
It's an unpopular folk tune

22:21.960 --> 22:24.680
that leaves a strong impression
due to its sad melody.

22:25.240 --> 22:26.800
But how can this compare

22:26.880 --> 22:29.000
to "Wild Geese on the Shoal"?

22:30.280 --> 22:32.760
There's a world of difference
between them.

22:53.640 --> 22:56.320
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

23:03.000 --> 23:05.440
Is this the unpopular
folk tune you mentioned?

23:05.520 --> 23:07.080
It's the same piece.

23:07.560 --> 23:10.480
But the finger techniques and methods
are entirely different.

23:14.000 --> 23:15.040
The sound of your music

23:16.760 --> 23:19.440
reflects the vastness of the world
and the depth of humanity.

23:20.760 --> 23:22.320
It's truly marvelous.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.680
It's as if the music is alive.

23:38.320 --> 23:44.920
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

24:45.440 --> 24:47.400
The sudden shift in emotions…

24:47.480 --> 24:51.040
It delivers such deep helplessness.

28:30.760 --> 28:32.640
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms"

28:33.360 --> 28:35.160
is a folk tune

28:35.240 --> 28:38.760
expressing a woman's lament
about her fate,

28:40.160 --> 28:42.120
filled with sorrow and grief.

28:43.200 --> 28:44.720
How can a young girl play this piece

28:45.280 --> 28:48.360
with such understanding

28:49.120 --> 28:52.280
as if she's experienced great injustice?

29:34.320 --> 29:39.440
This piece sounds so sad
that it brings tears to the listeners.

29:40.840 --> 29:43.920
But Mr. Shen,
why are you sweating so much?

29:48.760 --> 29:52.240
The performance is captivating

29:52.920 --> 29:53.840
and moving.

30:25.440 --> 30:26.880
I am

30:28.160 --> 30:29.280
at a loss for words.

30:30.680 --> 30:32.240
No words can describe it at all.

30:32.840 --> 30:35.840
No compliment can do you justice.

30:35.920 --> 30:38.160
This "Spring Fading
into White Pear Blossoms"

30:38.240 --> 30:41.800
is different from what I heard before.

30:42.680 --> 30:44.440
Did you arrange it differently?

30:44.520 --> 30:46.720
I was moved by the melody

30:47.440 --> 30:48.840
when I first heard it,

30:50.080 --> 30:51.400
so I added my own understanding

30:51.480 --> 30:54.400
during practice.

30:54.480 --> 30:55.960
I hope I didn't make a fool of myself.

30:57.280 --> 30:58.360
At such a young age,

30:58.960 --> 31:01.400
not only can you play,
but you can also compose.

31:01.480 --> 31:04.680
Truly, the younger generation is talented.

31:08.000 --> 31:09.000
It's all good now.

31:09.600 --> 31:11.440
- Jiang Li, you're incredible.
- Amazing.

31:11.520 --> 31:13.520
I never heard
the piece you played just now,

31:13.600 --> 31:15.040
but it left me completely spellbound.

31:15.120 --> 31:16.680
You'll definitely win first place.

31:16.760 --> 31:18.800
Li Lian and his team
don't stand a chance at all now.

31:18.880 --> 31:21.280
What if they placed their bets
on Jiang Ruoyao?

31:21.360 --> 31:22.200
What?

31:23.200 --> 31:24.600
I was observing them earlier.

31:25.160 --> 31:27.440
Li Lian and the rest
didn't pay attention to their teammate.

31:28.000 --> 31:29.600
They were more focused on Jiang Ruoyao.

31:30.120 --> 31:31.760
I think they know

31:32.400 --> 31:33.920
that the only way for us to beat them

31:34.440 --> 31:36.320
is for Jiang Li
to outperform Jiang Ruoyao.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.360
To stop us from taking first place,

31:39.480 --> 31:41.120
they're willing to help Jiang Ruoyao.

31:41.200 --> 31:42.680
Who do you think they've bribed?

31:42.760 --> 31:44.000
Mian Ju is a musical fanatic,

31:44.680 --> 31:46.160
so it's unlikely they could sway him.

31:46.240 --> 31:48.280
Fairy Jinghong is Jiang Ruoyao's teacher,

31:48.760 --> 31:49.920
so she'll naturally be biased.

31:50.000 --> 31:51.440
That leaves the other three.

31:52.080 --> 31:55.520
Jiang Li's piece, "Spring Fading
into White Pear Blossoms,"

31:56.120 --> 31:59.360
is the best in terms
of technique, artistry,

31:59.920 --> 32:01.080
and emotion.

32:03.760 --> 32:05.760
I'm sure all of you agree with me.

32:07.760 --> 32:09.840
While Jiang Li's performance
was full of emotions,

32:10.320 --> 32:11.920
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms"

32:12.000 --> 32:13.360
might be too melancholic.

32:14.200 --> 32:16.240
I'm afraid others
can't fully appreciate it.

32:16.800 --> 32:18.040
"Wild Geese on the Shoal"

32:18.120 --> 32:19.600
is clearer and more understandable.

32:20.920 --> 32:22.560
The soul of music is like the human soul.

32:23.440 --> 32:27.040
I think the latter has a broader meaning.

32:29.280 --> 32:30.120
Nice.

32:30.640 --> 32:32.240
I had no idea

32:32.320 --> 32:34.560
there were levels
to the soul of music until today.

32:36.480 --> 32:37.520
Forgive me for being frank,

32:38.080 --> 32:39.760
but what you said

32:39.840 --> 32:41.320
is complete nonsense.

32:42.280 --> 32:44.600
Mr. Mian Ju, since I was asked to judge,

32:45.320 --> 32:47.240
don't make me conform to your views.

32:47.720 --> 32:49.000
Everyone judges differently.

32:49.480 --> 32:51.280
I won't argue with you,

32:51.360 --> 32:53.040
so don't argue with me too.

32:53.120 --> 32:53.960
Forget it.

32:54.440 --> 32:57.600
I know you favor your own famous work.

32:57.680 --> 33:00.640
But even without your vote,
the result wouldn't change.

33:01.560 --> 33:03.200
Ms. Xiao, don't you agree?

33:15.960 --> 33:17.080
I'll cast my vote

33:18.120 --> 33:19.280
for Jiang Ruoyao.

33:21.560 --> 33:22.440
What?

33:23.080 --> 33:24.640
Have I become deaf

33:24.720 --> 33:27.080
or have you lost your mind too?

33:27.560 --> 33:30.680
Jiang Li and Jiang Ruoyao
are both your students.

33:30.760 --> 33:32.440
Did someone pay you?

33:33.280 --> 33:34.440
Mr. Mian Ju, watch your words.

33:34.920 --> 33:37.880
The School of Integrity teaches
guqin skills and techniques

33:38.560 --> 33:41.120
to help students
perform pieces more richly.

33:41.200 --> 33:43.760
Jiang Li's music
is indeed emotionally rich,

33:44.240 --> 33:47.040
but her technique falls short.

33:47.120 --> 33:50.400
Jiang Ruoyao's technique is
more mature and stable than hers.

33:50.960 --> 33:53.080
It's clearly the result
of a long, diligent practice.

33:53.160 --> 33:55.400
Our school encourages students

33:55.480 --> 33:57.760
to thoroughly master their skills.

33:57.840 --> 33:58.800
So

34:00.080 --> 34:01.240
I vote for Jiang Ruoyao.

34:01.320 --> 34:02.840
Your words clear up

34:03.640 --> 34:05.800
a long-standing confusion for me.

34:05.880 --> 34:07.800
I've wondered why the School of Integrity

34:07.880 --> 34:09.400
has produced so many average musicians,

34:09.480 --> 34:11.440
- but no masters.
- You…

34:13.199 --> 34:15.639
Duke Su, who will you cast your vote for?

34:16.639 --> 34:19.320
I'm not a guqin player,
but a guqin listener.

34:20.280 --> 34:21.560
I cannot comment on techniques.

34:22.120 --> 34:23.400
I can only tell you what I think.

34:23.880 --> 34:28.360
There's only a one-word difference
between guqin fanatic and love fanatic

34:28.440 --> 34:31.000
and both were captured
in Jiang Li's music.

34:31.080 --> 34:33.880
Her piece tells the story
of a betrayed lover of guqin

34:33.960 --> 34:35.280
with a tragic end.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.679
I pity this woman's sorrow

34:37.760 --> 34:39.360
and admire her strength.

34:39.440 --> 34:40.760
XIAO HENG

34:58.160 --> 35:01.240
With my vote, I wish the guqin player

35:01.320 --> 35:02.400
would get her revenge

35:03.920 --> 35:05.400
and a bright future.

35:09.440 --> 35:11.240
Great! As expected of Duke Su.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.760
Finally, someone in the right mind.

35:13.840 --> 35:14.880
Mr. Shen,

35:14.960 --> 35:18.080
the result between the two of them
is up to you now.

35:22.040 --> 35:24.880
SHEN YURONG

35:30.000 --> 35:30.840
What are you doing?

35:31.400 --> 35:32.480
- Give it to me.
- Well…

35:37.400 --> 35:38.920
You've done enough for me already.

35:39.000 --> 35:40.800
If I can't even keep the guqin you own,

35:40.880 --> 35:42.480
how can I face anyone?

35:43.520 --> 35:45.520
I won't take
the Imperial Examination anymore.

35:49.480 --> 35:51.960
We can still redeem the guqin
after selling it.

35:52.040 --> 35:53.240
I'm just a woman.

35:53.920 --> 35:55.720
I only play the guqin as a hobby.

35:55.800 --> 35:57.520
You have outstanding talent
to serve the nation.

35:57.600 --> 35:58.960
Don't worry about money matters.

35:59.560 --> 36:02.520
The Imperial Examination
is your way of realizing your ambitions,

36:02.600 --> 36:04.560
so don't be silly, dear.

36:04.640 --> 36:06.680
But you don't need
to go to this extent for me.

36:07.640 --> 36:09.600
I've failed
my father-in-law's trust in me.

36:09.680 --> 36:12.760
Buy me a good guqin after you pass
the exam with flying colors.

36:13.680 --> 36:15.000
- But--
- Go and study first.

36:15.080 --> 36:15.920
I'll be back soon.

36:25.920 --> 36:30.040
TAIJI HALL

36:31.760 --> 36:33.680
They say Mr. Shen is fair and just.

36:34.160 --> 36:37.280
I wonder who you think is better.

36:38.840 --> 36:39.960
Speaking of which,

36:40.040 --> 36:43.200
I've been to Zhennv Hall
at Qingcheng Mountain too.

36:43.280 --> 36:46.160
It's desolate and lonely.

36:46.240 --> 36:47.560
It's a pity that a poor weak woman

36:48.320 --> 36:51.920
was once left alone in the mountains.

36:56.160 --> 36:57.520
I buried her

36:57.600 --> 36:59.120
with my own hands.

36:59.200 --> 37:01.080
Xue Fangfei is dead.

37:01.160 --> 37:02.120
She's dead!

38:40.160 --> 38:42.240
MIAN JU, FAIRY JINGHONG

38:42.760 --> 38:45.160
XIAO HENG, XIAO DEYIN

38:46.280 --> 38:48.040
SHEN YURONG

38:48.120 --> 38:52.080
RESPECT AND EMULATE THE EXCELLENT

38:52.840 --> 38:53.920
You were amazing just now.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.480
They were all shocked.

38:55.560 --> 38:56.400
You're so incredible.

38:56.480 --> 38:57.520
Ms. Jiang Li.

38:57.600 --> 38:59.280
- Mr. Wang is…
- Sure.

39:00.520 --> 39:02.400
Congratulations on winning
first place in guqin.

39:02.480 --> 39:04.360
I thought you would be

39:04.440 --> 39:06.040
by Ruoyao's side at this moment.

39:06.120 --> 39:07.680
There's no need

39:07.760 --> 39:09.000
to push me toward her.

39:09.080 --> 39:10.680
We were actually the ones

39:11.400 --> 39:12.520
who were engaged before.

39:12.600 --> 39:15.040
Zhou Yanbang, stop being a flirt.

39:15.120 --> 39:16.800
You're engaged,
so don't flirt with others.

39:16.880 --> 39:19.040
You should know about the engagement.

39:19.120 --> 39:20.560
They were engaged before?

39:21.640 --> 39:23.240
Actually, as long as you agree,

39:23.800 --> 39:25.760
I can persuade my mother

39:27.440 --> 39:28.640
to change back the engagement.

39:28.720 --> 39:30.200
Who do you think you are?

39:31.000 --> 39:32.000
Liu Xu.

39:33.840 --> 39:34.960
I…

39:37.920 --> 39:38.760
refuse.

39:43.840 --> 39:44.880
You're amazing.

39:51.440 --> 39:52.680
- Come on!
- The results are out.

39:52.760 --> 39:54.920
- The ranking is out!
- She won!

39:55.000 --> 39:56.760
- Jiang Li is in first place.
- How can this be?

39:57.240 --> 39:58.480
- How can this happen?
- Move.

40:01.320 --> 40:02.840
It's Jiang Li's team.

40:03.400 --> 40:06.800
My hard-earned money!

40:06.880 --> 40:08.960
My hard-earned money!

40:09.040 --> 40:10.200
Did you read it wrongly?

40:10.720 --> 40:11.760
Stop saying nonsense!

40:15.320 --> 40:17.240
Ms. Jiang Li was sent away

40:17.320 --> 40:19.720
when she was little.

40:20.200 --> 40:23.400
She stayed at Zhennv Hall for ten years.

40:24.840 --> 40:26.280
During those ten years,

40:26.360 --> 40:28.360
she was unknown.

40:29.200 --> 40:30.720
But after this battle,

40:31.480 --> 40:36.800
her name shook the capital.

40:37.280 --> 40:39.160
It sure is great news.

40:39.240 --> 40:40.560
Congratulations, Chancellor Jiang.

40:41.040 --> 40:42.680
You sure taught your daughter well.

40:42.760 --> 40:44.880
I'm truly envious of you.

40:44.960 --> 40:46.760
Yes, all of us feel the same way.

40:46.840 --> 40:48.920
- Chancellor Li.
- I'm so envious.

40:50.000 --> 40:52.200
Victory and defeat are common in battle.

40:52.280 --> 40:54.000
We both know that.

40:54.080 --> 40:56.880
A wager is just a game between kids.

40:56.960 --> 40:58.800
Li Lian is your second son.

40:58.880 --> 41:01.800
Let's forget about him becoming a monk.

41:01.880 --> 41:02.720
Jiang Yuanbai,

41:03.440 --> 41:05.200
don't make my son look untrustworthy.

41:05.280 --> 41:06.240
Then let him become a monk.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.480
Which temple?

41:08.040 --> 41:10.720
Don't forget to send word to my residence.

41:11.320 --> 41:13.280
My wife is also a Buddhist.

41:13.360 --> 41:15.440
She'll go there to pray.

41:15.520 --> 41:17.320
Before offering incense,

41:17.400 --> 41:18.920
don't forget to watch

41:19.000 --> 41:20.960
both of your daughters

41:21.040 --> 41:22.600
in case both of them fight.

41:23.160 --> 41:25.400
Everyone, let's enjoy the show.

41:25.480 --> 41:28.520
Two women fighting is quite a sight.

41:28.600 --> 41:32.360
Chancellor Li, so which temple?

41:32.840 --> 41:34.520
Let me know

41:34.600 --> 41:36.880
when he takes his vows.

41:38.960 --> 41:40.560
JIANG RESIDENCE

41:42.760 --> 41:44.000
Who are you to win against me?

41:51.920 --> 41:52.840
Ms. Ruoyao.

41:53.320 --> 41:54.880
Ms. Ruoyao.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.200
Open this door.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.280
Ms. Ruoyao.

41:57.360 --> 41:58.560
What's going on?

41:58.640 --> 42:01.120
Everyone in the house knows
that you're making a fuss here.

42:01.200 --> 42:02.880
Losing a contest is one thing,

42:02.960 --> 42:04.360
but don't lose your integrity.

42:04.440 --> 42:06.320
Ms. Ruoyao locked herself in the room.

42:06.400 --> 42:08.040
I can't persuade her to come out.

42:08.120 --> 42:10.040
It's fine to lose a contest,

42:10.560 --> 42:12.520
but now there are rumors everywhere

42:14.520 --> 42:18.480
saying that Mr. Zhou wants to break off
the engagement with Ms. Ruoyao.

42:20.360 --> 42:21.280
Go now.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.360
- Yes.
- Yes.

42:24.200 --> 42:25.360
Where did you hear that?

42:25.440 --> 42:27.400
It's spreading among the female nobles.

42:27.480 --> 42:28.760
They said Mr. Zhou

42:28.840 --> 42:30.640
approached Jiang Li
after the guqin competition

42:30.720 --> 42:32.200
to set up a new engagement with her.

42:32.280 --> 42:35.120
Ridiculous.
How can an engagement just be changed?

42:35.200 --> 42:36.360
Why didn't you talk to her?

42:36.440 --> 42:38.040
She's always so immature.

42:38.600 --> 42:40.880
She's making such a huge commotion at home

42:40.960 --> 42:42.520
over some baseless rumors outside.

42:42.600 --> 42:43.920
Where are her manners?

42:44.000 --> 42:45.360
After studying guqin for so many years,

42:45.440 --> 42:47.240
she even loses
to a wild girl from Zhennv Hall.

42:48.840 --> 42:49.760
Something is not right.

42:51.600 --> 42:53.360
She spent so many years at Zhennv Hall.

42:54.240 --> 42:55.640
Forget about practicing calligraphy.

42:56.200 --> 42:58.320
How can those girls
let her learn the guqin,

42:59.120 --> 43:00.960
let alone learn it so well?

43:01.040 --> 43:01.880
It's indeed fishy.

43:02.360 --> 43:03.200
Go and find out

43:04.200 --> 43:06.400
where the former Zhennv Hall's chief

43:07.160 --> 43:08.280
is locked up now.

43:08.360 --> 43:11.200
Do we want to find out
who Jiang Li learned the guqin from?

43:11.280 --> 43:15.080
Since she returned,
something has felt off to me.

43:16.480 --> 43:17.840
Maybe

43:17.920 --> 43:20.320
she isn't Jiang Li at all.
